      valid credential again ......... EAP-Success   (24 frames, so the refusals did not wedge the port)
CAVEAT:  Every leg was started after `dot1x initialize interface port1.0.48` on the DUT.
         This run does not show what happens when a new EAP session starts while an old
         one is still live.  The local RADIUS server counts twice for one PEAP
         authentication, once for the outer exchange and once for the inner, so its
         `Successes` value is not a count of authentications.
