STEP 2 -- a valid credential must authenticate with EAP-PEAP              PASS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Method: run wpa_supplicant on the host with method PEAP and the correct password.
  The tool starts the capture first, then the supplicant, then decodes the capture, so
